     A          R FHIERTYP2
     A*%%TS  DD  19931119  073523  T881S32     REL-V2R2M0  5733-073
     A                                      PUTOVR
     A                                      CF01
     A                                      CF02
     A                                  1  2'-----'
     A                                  2  1': 1 :'
     A                                  2 28'Copy Subsystem Help Screen'
     A                                  3  1'-----'
     A                                  5  1'-----------------------------------
     A                                      ------------------------------------
     A                                      ----------'
     A                                  6  1'This program copies a certain leve-
     A                                      l (next lower level of subsystems),-
     A                                       all lower'
     A                                  7  1'levels of a specific subsystem , o-
     A                                      r all the subsystems. The program'
     A                                  7 69'performs'
     A                                  8  1'only 1 of these copies at a time.'
     A                                  8 35'It copies from one type number to'
     A                                  8 69'another as'
     A                                  9  1'well as copying entries within the'
     A                                  9 36'same type number.'
     A                                 11  1'For example  .....................-
     A                                      ...................................-
     A                                      ...'
     A                                 12 14'. Copy 31225000_1500   to   325050-
     A                                      00_1500 - option 1 or 2 .'
     A                                 13 14'.      31225000_8400   to   325050-
     A                                      00_2350 - option 1      .'
     A                                 14 14'.      31225000_7000   to   312250-
     A                                      00_8000 - option 1 or 2 .'
     A                                 15 14'.      31225000'
     A                                 15 37'to   32311000      - option 3'
     A                                 15 72'.'
     A                                 16 14'..................................-
     A                                      .........................'
     A                                 18  1'The program will not copy subsyste-
     A                                      ms to an equipment type number wher-
     A                                      e the sub '
     A                                 19  1'systems already exist. If this is'
     A                                 19 35'attempted the program will display'
     A                                 19 70'a message'
     A                                 20  1'and disallow the copy.'
     A                                 22  1'To copy all the subsystems the new'
     A                                 22 36'type number must not exist at all'
     A                                 22 70'within the'
     A                                 23  1'subsystem file.'
     A            COMMANDLN1    79A  B 24  1DFTVAL('f1-NEXT PAGE f3-EXIT       -
     A                                                                         -
     A                                                       ')
     A                                      DSPATR(PR)
     A                                      OVRDTA
     A  99        MESSAGELN1    79   M      OVRDTA
     A          R FHIERTYP3
     A*%%TS  DD  19931119  073523  T881S32     REL-V2R2M0  5733-073
     A                                      PUTOVR
     A                                      CF01
     A                                      CF02
     A                                  1  2'-----'
     A                                  2  1': 2 :'
     A                                  2 28'Copy Subsystem Help Screen'
     A                                  3  1'-----'
     A                                  5  1'-----------------------------------
     A                                      ------------------------------------
     A                                      ----------'
     A                                  6  1'To use copy option 1 or 2 first le-
     A                                      vel subsystems must exist for the'
     A                                  6 69'type number'
     A                                  7  1'that will receive the copies.'
     A                                  9  1'To copy the next lower level subsy-
     A                                      stems of a specific subsystem (opti-
     A                                      ons 1 & 2)'
     A                                 10  1'for example the 2500 level (which'
     A                                 10 35'would include 2510 thru 2590) ...'
     A                                 10 69'the parent'
     A                                 11  1'entry (from which all these entrie-
     A                                      s branch from) must exist for the'
     A                                 11 69'new type'
     A                                 12  1'number. In this case that entry is'
     A                                 12 36'2500.'
     A                                 14  1'For all three options both type nu-
     A                                      mbers are required (same or differe-
     A                                      nt).'
     A                                 16  1'For copy option 1, the old subsyst-
     A                                      em is required. The new subsystem'
     A                                 16 69'defaults'
     A                                 17  1'to the old if left blank. You can'
     A                                 17 35'copy the next lower level subsyste-
     A                                      ms for any'
     A                                 18  1'specific subsystem of a type numbe-
     A                                      r to any other subsystem of a type'
     A                                 18 70'number.'
     A                                 20  1'For copy option 2, the old subsyst-
     A                                      em is required. The new subsystem'
     A                                 20 69'defaults'
     A                                 21  1'to the old if left blank. This opt-
     A                                      ion allows you to copy all entries'
     A                                 21 70'branching'
     A                                 22  1'from a particular entry. The old e-
     A                                      ntry and the new entry must have th-
     A                                      e same num'
     A                                 23  1'ber of "0"s. For example copy ....-
     A                                      .. 1500 to 8700   9000 to 1000   35-
     A                                      60 to 5550'
     A            COMMANDLN1    79A  B 24  1DFTVAL('f1-NEXT PAGE f3-EXIT       -
     A                                                                         -
     A                                                       ')
     A                                      DSPATR(PR)
     A                                      OVRDTA
     A  99        MESSAGELN1    79   M      OVRDTA
     A          R FHIERTYP4
